# The cutover publishes a build that has lost a key.
MODULE: MigrationReadEquivalentCutoverDropsKey
TARGET: MigrationReadEquivalent
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a completed migration deletes a value it was meant to re-stamp
PERTURBS: MigrateCutover

--- FIND
    /\ data' = shadow /\ shadow' = Blank
--- REPLACE
    /\ data' = [shadow EXCEPT ![1] = Abs] /\ shadow' = Blank
--- END